# Large generated or recorded files. `-diff` keeps a change to one of these
# from printing hundreds of KB of one-line JSON into `git diff`, `git show`,
# a pull request review, or an agent's context; `git diff --text` still shows
# it. `linguist-generated` collapses the file in Forgejo's pull request view.
crates/plurxd/src/web/hls.min.js -diff linguist-generated
docs/**/evidence/**/*.json -diff linguist-generated
benchmarks/evidence/** linguist-generated
tests/ui-structure.golden linguist-generated
